# Product Management API

A Django Rest Framework (DRF) API for managing products, categories, and user authentication.

## Features

- **User Authentication**
  - Register
  - Login
  - Token-based Authentication
  - Email Confirmation
  - Password Reset via Email
  - Password Update
- **Product Management (CRUD)**
- **Filtering & Ordering** (by price, category, commune, wilaya)
- **Image Upload** for products
- **Product Save & Unsave**
- **Retrieve Saved Products**
- **Retrieve User Products**
- **Role-Based Permissions**

---

## Installation

### 1️⃣ Clone the repository

```sh
git clone https://github.com/aitemrar-younes/ouedkhmiss.git
cd ouedkhmiss/backend
```

### 2️⃣ Create and activate a virtual environment

```sh
python -m venv venv
source venv/bin/activate  # On Windows: venv\Scripts\activate
```

### 3️⃣ Install dependencies

```sh
pip install -r requirements.txt
```

### 4️⃣ Create a `.env` file and set environment variables

Inside the `backend/` directory, create a `.env` file and add the following:

```ini
SECRET_KEY=your_secret_key_here
DEBUG=True  # Set to False in production
EMAIL_HOST_USER=your_email@example.com
EMAIL_HOST_PASSWORD=your_email_password
```

> ⚠️ **Note:** Never share your `.env` file or push it to version control. Add it to `.gitignore`.

### 5️⃣ Apply database migrations

```sh
python manage.py makemigrations
python manage.py migrate
```

### 6️⃣ Testing API Endpoints

To test all API endpoints, open the `api_test.http` file in VS Code.

> ✅ **Tip:** Install the **REST Client** extension in VS Code for better API testing experience.

---

## API Endpoints

### 🔹 Authentication

| Method | Endpoint                  | Description |
|--------|---------------------------|-------------|
| POST   | `/api/v1/auth/register/`     | Register a new user |
| POST   | `/api/v1/auth/login/`        | Authenticate and get a token |
| POST   | `/api/v1/auth/logout/`       | Logout and invalidate token |
| POST   | `/api/v1/auth/password_reset_request/` | Request password reset |
| POST   | `/api/v1/auth/password_reset/` | password reset |
| POST   | `/api/v1/auth/password_update/` | Update password |
| GET    | `/api/v1/auth/activate/` | Confirm email address |

### 🔹 Product Management

| Method | Endpoint                  | Description |
|--------|---------------------------|-------------|
| GET    | `/api/products/`          | List all products |
| POST   | `/api/products/`          | Create a new product |
| GET    | `/api/products/{id}/`     | Retrieve product details |
| PUT    | `/api/products/{id}/`     | Update a product |
| DELETE | `/api/products/{id}/`     | Delete a product |

### 🔹 Product Features

| Method | Endpoint                                | Description |
|--------|-----------------------------------------|-------------|
| GET    | `/api/products/saved/`                 | Get all saved products for a user |
| POST   | `/api/products/{id}/save/`             | Save a product |
| DELETE | `/api/products/{id}/unsave/`           | Unsave a product |
| GET    | `/api/products/{user_id}/user/`        | Get all products of a specific user |

### 🔹 Filtering & Ordering

| Method | Endpoint                            | Description |
|--------|-------------------------------------|-------------|
| GET    | `/api/products/?category={id}`     | Filter products by category |
| GET    | `/api/products/?price_min={value}` | Filter products by minimum price |
| GET    | `/api/products/?price_max={value}` | Filter products by maximum price |
| GET    | `/api/products/?commune={id}`      | Filter products by commune |
| GET    | `/api/products/?wilaya={id}`       | Filter products by wilaya |
| GET    | `/api/products/?ordering=price`    | Order products by price (ascending) |
| GET    | `/api/products/?ordering=-price`   | Order products by price (descending) |

